    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c8 Black Mystery: Wujing is A challenging A-RPG and pixel-style lightly casual Rogue-like game inspired by the myth of the Chinese Journey to the West. The story is based on Journey to the West, one of the &quot;Four Great classical novels&quot; of China.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But this time is not the Wukong, you will play Wukong's younger brother &quot;Wujing&quot;, in order to save his wife, retracing the West journey, write an NPC adventure epic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c8 The game places players in a miniature journey west in a parallel universe. Here, you can encounter all kinds of demons and demons. As &quot;Sha Wujing&quot;, you need to reach Last Mountain, destroy the demons of every level, and complete the arduous task! Of course, you need to awaken your lost god memories......</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c8 There are many combat skills to explore in the game, you will encounter many powerful enemies and opponents, and fight them to the death. Practice a variety of magical spells and item combinations, delve into the experience and discover your favorite skills to Battle and Fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/0ec9e1666fdf18984eba89f7b17cfaa3.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sun Wukong Pigsy white dragon horse together recommended</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/4b76175bd7c1e8867b136ba9a942ad27.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sha Wujing, the journey is long, you must closely follow Wukong ah!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wukong</strong>, Master has been captured by a monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wukong</strong>, the second brother has been taken by a monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wukong</strong>, Master and second brother have been captured by monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master, don't worry. Big Brother\u00a0<strong>Wukong</strong> will come and save us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Big Brother\u00a0<strong>Wukong</strong> is right: &quot;Play hard and rest well!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/65a651b6a67d4d62155b522e8061b057.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The most nonexistent NPC ever bottomed out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/8122434880a48f2770e4ea27c9a0202c.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I am Sha Wujing, the villagers call me Jingjing, I also have my own story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there had not been a Master brother Wukong, would you have embarked on the path of enlightenment?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now that the Master Wukong has come, Jingjing can no longer be quiet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/9072b99ffe182a35a8f83e7f416fdc0b.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ask what LOVE are in the world, and teach people to commit to life and death!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/9e8029a73278695642fa56d9080267af.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I can't believe that Brother Sha and I are just as crazy for love!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the path of a mortal man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an independent game with Sha Wujing as the prototype protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a tale of self-growth, faith and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story begins with the Quicksand River.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/a26c00938ff7b9d1705367e2e30c075b.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baby, add a wish list!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442390/extras/4689d146075dbd1f350fa10857005dc3.avif?t=1753825179\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little brother Sha Wujing, tell your story to everyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
